<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals 9,791 bags in latest week.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals 9,791 bags in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia cocoa arrivals were 9,791 bags in the week ending March 16 compared to 13,887 bags in the corresponding period last year, Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said in a statement.</p>
<p>Total arrivals for the 1996/97 crop to-date were 2,803,033 bags against 2,582,155 bags in 1995/96, it added.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
